<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - White Rose - 140,000 tonnes Gladstone/Fos mid Feb high $9.00s fio 2.5 days shinc/four days shinc P and O.</p>
<p>ORE - Nessie - 90,000 tonnes Tuburao/Bahrain 15-25/2 $10.00 fio 24,000 shinc/20,000 shinc GIIC.</p>
<p>Angeliki - 100,000 tonnes Saldanha/Hansaport Jan/Feb $8.75 fio Krupp.</p>
</text>
